        "id": "p5",
        "label": "5",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "10 so that through the church the manifold wisdom of God might now be made known to the rulers and authorities in the heavenly places, according to the eternal purpose"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "label": "6",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "which he accomplished in Christ Jesus our Lord,"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "label": "7",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "12 in whom we have boldness and access with confidence through faith in him."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "label": "8",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "13 So I ask you"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "label": "9",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "not to lose heart over my sufferings for you,"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "label": "10",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "which is your glory."
        }
